  "ingredients": [
    "3/4 cup erythritol",
    "1 teaspoon butter",
    "1/8 cup water",
    "2 large egg yolk",
    "1/2 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "water (boiling)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "In a deep pot, heat up 1/3 of the sweetener on medium heat, stirring frequently, until melted and clear.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/keto-creme-brulee-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in the water. Note that it will start frothing and rising - that’s why we need a deep pot.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/keto-creme-brulee-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the butter. You will notice that the color of the sweetener turns darker and changes into a nice caramel.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/keto-creme-brulee-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the caramel turns a nice amber color, take it off the heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/keto-creme-brulee-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Evenly spoon the caramel into the ramekins. Set aside and let it harden.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/keto-creme-brulee-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F. In a bowl, mix the egg yolks and 1/3 of the sweetener.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, mix the heavy cream and vanilla.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/keto-creme-brulee-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowly whisk the heavy cream into the egg yolks.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/keto-creme-brulee-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour your cream mixture into the ramekins.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/keto-creme-brulee-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place them in a deep casserole dish or roasting pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/keto-creme-brulee-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill the outer dish up nearly full with boiling water, using extreme care not to get any in the ramekins!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/keto-creme-brulee-12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 45 minutes. When it’s done, you’ll notice the custard is firm on the outside and a little jiggly in the center. Allow to cool.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/keto-creme-brulee-13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon the rest of the sweetener evenly onto each custard.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-12",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/keto-creme-brulee-14.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a torch (or broiler), slowly caramelize the sugar substitute.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-13",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/keto-creme-brulee-15.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let it cool and harden. Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/caramel-creme-brulee/#wprm-recipe-52679-step-0-14",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
